wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9c7f00c7e89ba57dEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-c27f147a0de179a5END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_HagSpysNote</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_HagSpysNote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_HagSurvivors_HagSpysNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">97bfb610-9aa5-4183-bf60-972ad955b45a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:97bfb610-9aa5-4183-bf60-972ad955b45a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:97bfb610-9aa5-4183-bf60-972ad955b45a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/25px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/38px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/50px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jatlo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png/25px-Portrait_Jatlo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Portrait_Jatlo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jatlo\" title=\"Jatlo\">Jatlo</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My darling,\n</p><p>Auntie has sent you a little present - a hex doll, just for Mayrina. Use it to scare her and her little crones off. Or butcher them, I don't care - just <i>find that book.</i> Or I'll rip out your lungs and feed them to your brothers.\n</p><p><br>\nLots of love, Auntie\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Part of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Help the Hag Survivors\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help the Hag Survivors\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_the_Hag_Survivors\" title=\"Help the Hag Survivors\">Help the Hag Survivors</a></li>\n<li>The book Auntie Ethel is looking for is the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"The Hag's Bane\">The Hag's Bane</a>, which contains its <a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Bane\" title=\"Hag's Bane\">recipe</a></li></ul>\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag_Spy%27s_Note_(Mayrina_dead)\" title=\"Hag Spy's Note (Mayrina dead)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/38px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/50px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png/25px-Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Book_Note_M_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hag_Spy%27s_Note_(Mayrina_dead)\" title=\"Hag Spy's Note (Mayrina dead)\">Hag Spy's Note (Mayrina dead)</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214058\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.066 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2372/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35350/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9487/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1043540/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.032      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   53.032      1 -total\n 50.14%   26.591      9 Template:Icon_text\n 45.65%   24.209     27 Template:Trim\n 19.41%   10.296      2 Template:Uid\n 15.06%    7.988      4 Template:Icon_link\n 13.09%    6.942      1 Template:RarityItem\n 12.49%    6.622      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.95%    6.337      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.35%    6.021      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:32896-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214058 and revision id 365544. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}